    <innerclass refid="class_ring_buffer" prot="public">RingBuffer</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements a generic fixed-size ring buffer with serialization support. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file defines a templated <ref refid="class_ring_buffer" kindref="compound">RingBuffer</ref> class that stores a fixed number of elements in a circular buffer. It supports basic operations like push, clear, and mean calculation. The buffer can be serialized using Boost.Serialization. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
